silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_03_olog_node_arrow_law_concrete_anchor_8_witness_leg#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode8 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode8 is the typed source witness leg, concretely the cannon vet-record entry attesting that Alice owns Mittens and Mittens weighs 4.2 kg. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'witness_leg', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
